translate english prologo_teatro_0051:
    voice "voice/prologo_teatro_0051.ogg"
    c_clown "Posterity! Don’t name the word to me!\nIf I should choose to preach Posterity,\nWhere would you get contemporary fun?\nThat men will have it, there’s no blinking:"
    voice sustain
    c_clown "A fine young fellow’s presence, to my thinking,\nIs something worth, to every one.\nWho genially his nature can outpour,\nTakes from the People’s moods no irritation;"
    voice sustain
    c_clown "The wider circle he acquires, the more\nSecurely works his inspiration.\nThen pluck up heart, and give us sterling coin!\nLet Fancy be with her attendants fitted,—"
    voice sustain
    c_clown "Sense, Reason, Sentiment, and Passion join,—\nBut have a care, lest Folly be omitted!"

