translate english prologo_teatro_0185:
    voice "voice/prologo_teatro_0185.ogg"
    c_poet "Then give me back that time of pleasures,\nWhile yet in joyous growth I sang,—\nWhen, like a fount, the crowding measures\nUninterrupted gushed and sprang!"
    voice sustain
    c_poet "Then bright mist veiled the world before me,\nIn opening buds a marvel woke,\nAs I the thousand blossoms broke,\nWhich every valley richly bore me!"
    voice sustain
    c_poet "I nothing had, and yet enough for youth—\nJoy in Illusion, ardent thirst for Truth.\nGive, unrestrained, the old emotion,\nThe bliss that touched the verge of pain,"
    voice sustain
    c_poet "The strength of Hate, Love’s deep devotion,—\nO, give me back my youth again!"

