translate english prologo_cielo_0002:
    nvl clear
    c_narrator_nvl "The THREE ARCHANGELS come forward."
    nvl clear
    voice "voice/prologo_cielo_0002.ogg"
    c_raphael_nvl "The sun-orb sings, in emulation,\n’Mid brother-spheres, his ancient round:\nHis path predestined through Creation\nHe ends with step of thunder-sound.\nThe angels from his visage splendid\nDraw power, whose measure none can say;\nThe lofty works, uncomprehended,\nAre bright as on the earliest day."

