translate english noche_0083:
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Ha! what a sudden rapture leaps from this\nI view, through all my senses swiftly flowing!\nI feel a youthful, holy, vital bliss\nIn every vein and fibre newly glowing."
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Was it a God, who traced this sign,\nWith calm across my tumult stealing,\nMy troubled heart to joy unsealing,\nWith impulse, mystic and divine,"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "The powers of Nature here, around my path, revealing?\nAm I a God?—so clear mine eyes!\nIn these pure features I behold\nCreative Nature to my soul unfold."
    voice sustain
    c_faust "What says the sage, now first I recognize:\n“The spirit-world no closures fasten;\nThy sense is shut, thy heart is dead:\nDisciple, up! untiring, hasten"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "To bathe thy breast in morning-red!”"

