translate english gabinete_1_0105:
    voice "voice/gabinete_1_0105.ogg"
    c_faust "First, to encounter the beast,\nThe Words of the Four be addressed:\nSalamander, shine glorious!\nWave, Undine, as bidden!"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Sylph, be thou hidden!\nGnome, be laborious!"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Who knows not their sense\n(These elements),—\nTheir properties\nAnd power not sees,—"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "No mastery he inherits\nOver the Spirits."
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Vanish in flaming ether,\nSalamander!\nFlow foamingly together,\nUndine!"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Shine in meteor-sheen,\nSylph!\nBring help to hearth and shelf.\nIncubus! Incubus!"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Step forward, and finish thus!"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Of the Four, no feature\nLurks in the creature.\nQuiet he lies, and grins disdain:\nNot yet, it seems, have I given him pain."
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Now, to undisguise thee,\nHear me exorcise thee!\nArt thou, my gay one,\nHell’s fugitive stray-one?"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "The sign witness now,\nBefore which they bow,\nThe cohorts of Hell!"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "With hair all bristling, it begins to swell."
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Base Being, hearest thou?\nKnowest and fearest thou\nThe One, unoriginate,\nNamed inexpressibly,"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Through all Heaven impermeate,\nPierced irredressibly!"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Behind the stove still banned,\nSee it, an elephant, expand!\nIt fills the space entire,\nMist-like melting, ever faster."
    voice sustain
    c_faust "’Tis enough: ascend no higher,—\nLay thyself at the feet of the Master!\nThou seest, not vain the threats I bring thee:\nWith holy fire I’ll scorch and sting thee!"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Wait not to know\nThe threefold dazzling glow!\nWait not to know\nThe strongest art within my hands!"

