translate english gabinete_1_0208:
    voice "voice/gabinete_1_0208.ogg"
    c_mephisto "The modest truth I speak to thee.\nIf Man, that microcosmic fool, can see\nHimself a whole so frequently,\nPart of the Part am I, once All, in primal Night,—"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "Part of the Darkness which brought forth the Light,\nThe haughty Light, which now disputes the space,\nAnd claims of Mother Night her ancient place.\nAnd yet, the struggle fails; since Light, howe’er it weaves,"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "Still, fettered, unto bodies cleaves:\nIt flows from bodies, bodies beautifies;\nBy bodies is its course impeded;\nAnd so, but little time is needed,"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "I hope, ere, as the bodies die, it dies!"

