translate english gabinete_1_0238:
    voice "voice/gabinete_1_0238.ogg"
    c_mephisto "And truly ’tis not much, when all is done.\nThat which to Naught is in resistance set,—\nThe Something of this clumsy world,—has yet,\nWith all that I have undertaken,"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "Not been by me disturbed or shaken:\nFrom earthquake, tempest, wave, volcano’s brand,\nBack into quiet settle sea and land!\nAnd that damned stuff, the bestial, human brood,—"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "What use, in having that to play with?\nHow many have I made away with!\nAnd ever circulates a newer, fresher blood.\nIt makes me furious, such things beholding:"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "From Water, Earth, and Air unfolding,\nA thousand germs break forth and grow,\nIn dry, and wet, and warm, and chilly;\nAnd had I not the Flame reserved, why, really,"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "There’s nothing special of my own to show!"

