translate english gabinete_1_0367:
    voice "voice/gabinete_1_0367.ogg"
    c_spirits "Vanish, ye darking\nArches above him!\nLoveliest weather,\nBorn of blue ether,"
    voice sustain
    c_spirits "Break from the sky!\nO that the darkling\nClouds had departed!\nStarlight is sparkling,"
    voice sustain
    c_spirits "Tranquiller-hearted\nSuns are on high.\nHeaven’s own children\nIn beauty bewildering,"
    voice sustain
    c_spirits "Waveringly bending,\nPass as they hover;\nLonging unending\nFollows them over."
    voice sustain
    c_spirits "They, with their glowing\nGarments, out-flowing,\nCover, in going,\nLandscape and bower,"
    voice sustain
    c_spirits "Where, in seclusion,\nLovers are plighted,\nLost in illusion.\nBower on bower!"
    voice sustain
    c_spirits "Tendrils unblighted!\nLo! in a shower\nGrapes that o’ercluster\nGush into must, or"
    voice sustain
    c_spirits "Flow into rivers\nOf foaming and flashing\nWine, that is dashing\nGems, as it boundeth"
    voice sustain
    c_spirits "Down the high places,\nAnd spreading, surroundeth\nWith crystalline spaces,\nIn happy embraces,"
    voice sustain
    c_spirits "Blossoming forelands,\nEmerald shore-lands!\nAnd the winged races\nDrink, and fly onward—"
    voice sustain
    c_spirits "Fly ever sunward\nTo the enticing\nIslands, that flatter,\nDipping and rising"
    voice sustain
    c_spirits "Light on the water!\nHark, the inspiring\nSound of their quiring!\nSee, the entrancing"
    voice sustain
    c_spirits "Whirl of their dancing!\nAll in the air are\nFreer and fairer.\nSome of them scaling"
    voice sustain
    c_spirits "Boldly the highlands,\nOthers are sailing,\nCircling the islands;\nOthers are flying;"
    voice sustain
    c_spirits "Life-ward all hieing,—\nAll for the distant\nStar of existent\nRapture and Love!"

