translate english gabinete_2_0370:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0370.ogg"
    c_faust "I feel, indeed, that I have made the treasure\nOf human thought and knowledge mine, in vain;\nAnd if I now sit down in restful leisure,\nNo fount of newer strength is in my brain:"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "I am no hair’s-breadth more in height,\nNor nearer, to the Infinite,"

