translate english gabinete_2_0397:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0397.ogg"
    c_mephisto "We’ll try a wider sphere.\nWhat place of martyrdom is here!\nIs’t life, I ask, is’t even prudence,\nTo bore thyself and bore the students?"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "Let Neighbor Paunch to that attend!\nWhy plague thyself with threshing straw forever?\nThe best thou learnest, in the end\nThou dar’st not tell the youngsters—never!"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "I hear one’s footsteps, hither steering."

