    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0558.ogg"
    c_student "I cannot understand you quite."

translate english gabinete_2_0559:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0559.ogg"
    c_mephisto "Your mind will shortly be set aright,\nWhen you have learned, all things reducing,\nTo classify them for your using."

translate english gabinete_2_0563:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0563.ogg"
    c_student "I feel as stupid, from all you’ve said,\nAs if a mill-wheel whirled in my head!"

translate english gabinete_2_0566:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0566.ogg"
    c_mephisto "And after—first and foremost duty—Of\nMetaphysics learn the use and beauty!\nSee that you most profoundly gain\nWhat does not suit the human brain!"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "A splendid word to serve, you’ll find\nFor what goes in—or won’t go in—your mind.\nBut first, at least this half a year,\nTo order rigidly adhere;"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "Five hours a day, you understand,\nAnd when the clock strikes, be on hand!\nPrepare beforehand for your part\nWith paragraphs all got by heart,"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "So you can better watch, and look\nThat naught is said but what is in the book:\nYet in thy writing as unwearied be,\nAs did the Holy Ghost dictate to thee!"

