translate english gabinete_2_0598:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0598.ogg"
    c_mephisto "Nor can I therefore greatly blame you students:\nI know what science this has come to be.\nAll rights and laws are still transmitted\nLike an eternal sickness of the race,—"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "From generation unto generation fitted,\nAnd shifted round from place to place.\nReason becomes a sham, Beneficence a worry:\nThou art a grandchild, therefore woe to thee!"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "The right born with us, ours in verity,\nThis to consider, there’s, alas! no hurry."

