translate english gabinete_2_0611:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0611.ogg"
    c_student "My own disgust is strengthened by your speech:\nO lucky he, whom you shall teach!\nI’ve almost for Theology decided."

translate english gabinete_2_0615:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0615.ogg"
    c_mephisto "I should not wish to see you here misguided:\nFor, as regards this science, let me hint\n’Tis very hard to shun the false direction;\nThere’s so much secret poison lurking in ’t,"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "So like the medicine, it baffles your detection.\nHear, therefore, one alone, for that is best, in sooth,\nAnd simply take your master’s words for truth.\nOn words let your attention centre!"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "Then through the safest gate you’ll enter\nThe temple-halls of Certainty."

