translate english gabinete_2_0705:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0705.ogg"
    c_student "That’s better, now! The How and Where, one sees."

translate english gabinete_2_0709:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0709.ogg"
    c_mephisto "My worthy friend, gray are all theories,\nAnd green alone Life’s golden tree."

translate english gabinete_2_0713:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0713.ogg"
    c_student "I swear to you, ’tis like a dream to me.\nMight I again presume, with trust unbounded,\nTo hear your wisdom thoroughly expounded?"

translate english gabinete_2_0717:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0717.ogg"
    c_mephisto "Most willingly, to what extent I may."

translate english gabinete_2_0718:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0718.ogg"
    c_student "I cannot really go away:\nAllow me that my album first I reach you,—\nGrant me this favor, I beseech you!"
    c_mephisto "Assuredly."

translate english gabinete_2_0722:
    c_narrator "He writes, and returns the book."

translate english gabinete_2_0723:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0723.ogg"
    c_student "Eritis sicut Deus, scientes bonum et malum."

translate english gabinete_2_0724:
