    c_narrator "Closes the book with reverence, and withdraws"

translate english gabinete_2_0725:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0725.ogg"
    c_mephisto "Follow the ancient text, and the snake thou wast ordered to trample!\nWith all thy likeness to God, thou’lt yet be a sorry example!"

