translate english gabinete_2_0731:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0731.ogg"
    c_mephisto "As best it pleases thee.\nThe little world, and then the great, we’ll see.\nWith what delight, what profit winning,\nShalt thou sponge through the term beginning!"

