translate english gabinete_2_0738:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0738.ogg"
    c_faust "Yet with the flowing beard I wear,\nBoth ease and grace will fail me there.\nThe attempt, indeed, were a futile strife;\nI never could learn the ways of life."
    voice sustain
    c_faust "I feel so small before others, and thence\nShould always find embarrassments."

translate english gabinete_2_0742:
