translate english gabinete_2_0744:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0744.ogg"
    c_mephisto "My friend, thou soon shalt lose all such misgiving:\nBe thou but self-possessed, thou hast the art of living!"

translate english gabinete_2_0746:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0746.ogg"
    c_faust "How shall we leave the house, and start?\nWhere hast thou servant, coach and horses?"

translate english gabinete_2_0749:
    voice "voice/gabinete_2_0749.ogg"
