    c_narrator "Sings."

translate english taberna_auerbach_0055:
    voice sustain
    c_frosch "Draw the latch! the darkness makes:\nDraw the latch! the lover wakes.\nShut the latch! the morning breaks."

translate english taberna_auerbach_0059:
