translate english taberna_auerbach_0148:
    voice "voice/taberna_auerbach_0148.ogg"
    c_mephisto "Before all else, I bring thee hither\nWhere boon companions meet together,\nTo let thee see how smooth life runs away.\nHere, for the folk, each day’s a holiday:"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "With little wit, and ease to suit them,\nThey whirl in narrow, circling trails,\nLike kittens playing with their tails?\nAnd if no headache persecute them,"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "So long the host may credit give,\nThey merrily and careless live."

