translate english taberna_auerbach_0232:
    voice "voice/taberna_auerbach_0232.ogg"
    c_mephisto "There was a king once reigning,\nWho had a big black flea,\nAnd loved him past explaining,\nAs his own son were he."
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "He called his man of stitches;\nThe tailor came straightway:\nHere, measure the lad for breeches.\nAnd measure his coat, I say!"

