translate english calle_1_0036:
    voice "voice/calle_1_0036.ogg"
    c_faust "And yet, she’s older than fourteen."

translate english calle_1_0038:
    voice "voice/calle_1_0038.ogg"
    c_mephisto "How now! You’re talking like Jack Rake,\nWho every flower for himself would take,\nAnd fancies there are no favors more,\nNor honors, save for him in store;"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "Yet always doesn’t the thing succeed."

