translate english calle_1_0046:
    voice "voice/calle_1_0046.ogg"
    c_faust "Most Worthy Pedagogue, take heed!\nLet not a word of moral law be spoken!\nI claim, I tell thee, all my right;\nAnd if that image of delight"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Rest not within mine arms to-night,\nAt midnight is our compact broken."

translate english calle_1_0050:
    voice "voice/calle_1_0050.ogg"
    c_mephisto "But think, the chances of the case!\nI need, at least, a fortnight’s space,\nTo find an opportune occasion."

translate english calle_1_0054:
    voice "voice/calle_1_0054.ogg"
    c_faust "Had I but seven hours for all,\nI should not on the Devil call,\nBut win her by my own persuasion."

translate english calle_1_0058:
    voice "voice/calle_1_0058.ogg"
    c_mephisto "You almost like a Frenchman prate;\nYet, pray, don’t take it as annoyance!\nWhy, all at once, exhaust the joyance?\nYour bliss is by no means so great"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "As if you’d use, to get control,\nAll sorts of tender rigmarole,\nAnd knead and shape her to your thought,\nAs in Italian tales ’tis taught."

