translate english cuartito_0019:
    voice "voice/cuartito_0019.ogg"
    c_faust "O welcome, twilight soft and sweet,\nThat breathes throughout this hallowed shrine!\nSweet pain of love, bind thou with fetters fleet\nThe heart that on the dew of hope must pine!"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "How all around a sense impresses\nOf quiet, order, and content!\nThis poverty what bounty blesses!\nWhat bliss within this narrow den is pent!"

translate english cuartito_0023:
