translate english paseo_0002:
    c_narrator "FAUST, walking thoughtfully up and down. To him MEPHISTOPHELES."
    voice "voice/paseo_0002.ogg"
    c_mephisto "By all love ever rejected! By hell-fire hot and unsparing!\nI wish I knew something worse, that I might use it for\nswearing!"

translate english paseo_0006:
    voice "voice/paseo_0006.ogg"
    c_faust "What ails thee? What is’t gripes thee, elf?\nA face like thine beheld I never."

translate english paseo_0010:
    voice "voice/paseo_0010.ogg"
    c_mephisto "I would myself unto the Devil deliver,\nIf I were not a Devil myself!"

translate english paseo_0011:
