translate english jardin_0085:
    voice "voice/jardin_0085.ogg"
    c_faust "An angel, if like thee!"

translate english jardin_0087:
    voice "voice/jardin_0087.ogg"
    c_margarita "I brought it up, and it was fond of me.\nFather had died before it saw the light,\nAnd mother’s case seemed hopeless quite,\nSo weak and miserable she lay;"
    voice sustain
    c_margarita "And she recovered, then, so slowly, day by day.\nShe could not think, herself, of giving\nThe poor wee thing its natural living;\nAnd so I nursed it all alone"
    voice sustain
    c_margarita "With milk and water: ’twas my own.\nLulled in my lap with many a song,\nIt smiled, and tumbled, and grew strong."

