translate english jardin_0130:
    voice "voice/jardin_0130.ogg"
    c_marta "Yes, the poor women are bad off, ’tis true:\nA stubborn bachelor there’s no converting."

translate english jardin_0134:
    voice "voice/jardin_0134.ogg"
    c_mephisto "It but depends upon the like of you,\nAnd I should turn to better ways than flirting."

translate english jardin_0136:
    voice "voice/jardin_0136.ogg"
