translate english jardin_0138:
    voice "voice/jardin_0138.ogg"
    c_mephisto "The proverb says: One’s own warm hearth\nAnd a good wife, are gold and jewels worth."

translate english jardin_0142:
    voice "voice/jardin_0142.ogg"
    c_marta "I mean, have you not felt desire, though ne’er so slightly?"

translate english jardin_0144:
    voice "voice/jardin_0144.ogg"
    c_mephisto "I’ve everywhere, in fact, been entertained politely."

translate english jardin_0145:
    pass

translate english jardin_0147:
    voice "voice/jardin_0147.ogg"
    c_marta "I meant to say, were you not touched in earnest, ever?"

translate english jardin_0149:
    voice "voice/jardin_0149.ogg"
    c_mephisto "One should allow one’s self to jest with ladies never."

translate english jardin_0151:
    voice "voice/jardin_0151.ogg"
    c_marta "Ah, you don’t understand!"

translate english jardin_0153:
    voice "voice/jardin_0153.ogg"
    c_mephisto "I’m sorry I’m so blind:\nBut I am sure—that you are very kind."

