    voice "voice/jardin_0157.ogg"
    c_faust "And me, thou angel! didst thou recognize,\nAs through the garden-gate I came?"

translate english jardin_0159:
    voice "voice/jardin_0159.ogg"
    c_margarita "Did you not see it? I cast down my eyes."

translate english jardin_0161:
    voice "voice/jardin_0161.ogg"
    c_faust "And thou forgiv’st my freedom, and the blame\nTo my impertinence befitting,\nAs the Cathedral thou wert quitting?"

translate english jardin_0165:
    voice "voice/jardin_0165.ogg"
    c_margarita "I was confused, the like ne’er happened me;\nNo one could ever speak to my discredit.\nAh, thought I, in my conduct has he read it—\nSomething immodest or unseemly free?"
    voice sustain
    c_margarita "He seemed to have the sudden feeling\nThat with this wench ’twere very easy dealing.\nI will confess, I knew not what appeal\nOn your behalf, here, in my bosom grew;"
    voice sustain
    c_margarita "But I was angry with myself, to feel\nThat I could not be angrier with you."

