    nvl clear
    voice "voice/aposento_margarita_0001.ogg"
    c_margarita_nvl "My peace is gone,\nMy heart is sore:\nI never shall find it,\nAh, nevermore!"
    nvl clear
    voice sustain
    c_margarita_nvl "Save I have him near.\nThe grave is here;\nThe world is gall\nAnd bitterness all."
    nvl clear
    voice sustain
    c_margarita_nvl "My poor weak head\nIs racked and crazed;\nMy thought is lost,\nMy senses mazed."
    nvl clear
    voice sustain
    c_margarita_nvl "My peace is gone,\nMy heart is sore:\nI never shall find it,\nAh, nevermore!"
    nvl clear
    voice sustain
    c_margarita_nvl "To see him, him only,\nAt the pane I sit;\nTo meet him, him only,\nThe house I quit."
    nvl clear
    voice sustain
    c_margarita_nvl "His lofty gait,\nHis noble size,\nThe smile of his mouth,\nThe power of his eyes,"
    nvl clear
    voice sustain
    c_margarita_nvl "And the magic flow\nOf his talk, the bliss\nIn the clasp of his hand,\nAnd, ah! his kiss!"
    nvl clear
    voice sustain
    c_margarita_nvl "My peace is gone,\nMy heart is sore:\nI never shall find it,\nAh, nevermore!"
    nvl clear
    voice sustain
    c_margarita_nvl "My bosom yearns\nFor him alone;\nAh, dared I clasp him,\nAnd hold, and own!"
    nvl clear
    voice sustain
    c_margarita_nvl "And kiss his mouth,\nTo heart’s desire,\nAnd on his kisses\nAt last expire!"

