translate english jardin_marta_0041:
    voice "voice/jardin_marta_0041.ogg"
    c_faust "Hear me not falsely, sweetest countenance!\nWho dare express Him?\nAnd who profess Him,\nSaying: I believe in Him!"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Who, feeling, seeing,\nDeny His being,\nSaying: I believe Him not!\nThe All-enfolding,"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "The All-upholding,\nFolds and upholds he not\nThee, me, Himself?\nArches not there the sky above us?"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Lies not beneath us, firm, the earth?\nAnd rise not, on us shining,\nFriendly, the everlasting stars?\nLook I not, eye to eye, on thee,"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "And feel’st not, thronging\nTo head and heart, the force,\nStill weaving its eternal secret,\nInvisible, visible, round thy life?"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Vast as it is, fill with that force thy heart,\nAnd when thou in the feeling wholly blessed art,\nCall it, then, what thou wilt,—\nCall it Bliss! Heart! Love! God!"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "I have no name to give it!\nFeeling is all in all:\nThe Name is sound and smoke,\nObscuring Heaven’s clear glow."

