translate english catedral_0025:
    voice "voice/catedral_0025.ogg"
    c_evil_spirit "Wrath takes thee!\nThe trumpet peals!\nThe graves tremble!\nAnd thy heart"
    voice sustain
    c_evil_spirit "From ashy rest\nTo fiery torments\nNow again requickened,\nThrobs to life!"

