    c_margarita "Would I were forth!\nI feel as if the organ here\nMy breath takes from me,\nMy very heart"
    voice sustain
    c_margarita "Dissolved by the anthem!"

translate english catedral_0037:
    c_chorus "Judex ergo cum sedebit,\nQuidquid latet, ad parebit,\nNil inultum remanebit."

translate english catedral_0040:
    voice "voice/catedral_0040.ogg"
    c_margarita "I cannot breathe!\nThe massy pillars\nImprison me!\nThe vaulted arches"
    voice sustain
    c_margarita "Crush me!—Air!"

translate english catedral_0044:
    voice "voice/catedral_0044.ogg"
    c_evil_spirit "Hide thyself! Sin and shame\nStay never hidden.\nAir? Light?\nWoe to thee!"

translate english catedral_0048:
