translate english catedral_0051:
    voice "voice/catedral_0051.ogg"
    c_evil_spirit "They turn their faces,\nThe glorified, from thee:\nThe pure, their hands to offer,\nShuddering, refuse thee!"
    voice sustain
    c_evil_spirit "Woe!"

