translate english valpurgis_0009:
    voice "voice/valpurgis_0009.ogg"
    c_faust "So long as in my legs I feel the fresh existence.\nThis knotted staff suffices me.\nWhat need to shorten so the way?\nAlong this labyrinth of vales to wander,"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "Then climb the rocky ramparts yonder,\nWherefrom the fountain flings eternal spray,\nIs such delight, my steps would fain delay.\nThe spring-time stirs within the fragrant birches,"
    voice sustain
    c_faust "And even the fir-tree feels it now:\nShould then our limbs escape its gentle searches?"

