translate english valpurgis_0043:
    voice "voice/valpurgis_0043.ogg"
    c_wisp "My reverence, I hope, will me enable\nTo curb my temperament unstable;\nFor zigzag courses we are wont to keep."

translate english valpurgis_0047:
    voice "voice/valpurgis_0047.ogg"
    c_mephisto "Indeed? he’d like mankind to imitate!\nNow, in the Devil’s name, go straight,\nOr I’ll blow out his being’s flickering spark!"

translate english valpurgis_0051:
    c_wisp "You are the master of the house, I mark,\nAnd I shall try to serve you nicely.\nBut then, reflect: the mountain’s magic-mad to-day,\nAnd if a will-o’-the-wisp must guide you on the way,"
    c_wisp "You mustn’t take things too precisely."
    c_narrator "FAUST, MEPHISTOPHELES, WILL-O’-THE-WISP (in alternating song)"

