translate english valpurgis_0091:
    voice "voice/valpurgis_0091.ogg"
    c_mephisto "Grasp my skirt with heart undaunted!\nHere a middle-peak is planted,\nWhence one seeth, with amaze,\nMammon in the mountain blaze."

