translate english valpurgis_0230:
    nvl clear
    voice "voice/valpurgis_0230.ogg"
    c_witches_nvl "When round the summit whirls our flight,\nThen lower, and on the ground alight;\nAnd far and wide the heather press\nWith witchhood’s swarms of wantonness!"
    nvl clear
    voice sustain
    c_narrator_nvl "They settle down."

translate english valpurgis_0234:
    voice "voice/valpurgis_0234.ogg"
    c_mephisto "They crowd and push, they roar and clatter!\nThey whirl and whistle, pull and chatter!\nThey shine, and spirt, and stink, and burn!\nThe true witch-element we learn."
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "Keep close! or we are parted, in our turn,\nWhere art thou?"

