    c_faust "Here!"

translate english valpurgis_0244:
    voice "voice/valpurgis_0244.ogg"
    c_mephisto "What! whirled so far astray?\nThen house-right I must use, and clear the way.\nMake room! Squire Voland comes! Room, gentle rabble,\nroom!"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "Here, Doctor, hold to me: in one jump we’ll resume\nAn easier space, and from the crowd be free:\nIt’s too much, even for the like of me.\nYonder, with special light, there’s something shining clearer"
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "Within those bushes; I’ve a mind to see.\nCome on! we’ll slip a little nearer."

