    voice "voice/valpurgis_0259.ogg"
    c_faust "Spirit of Contradiction! On! I’ll follow straight.\n’Tis planned most wisely, if I judge aright:\nWe climb the Brocken’s top in the Walpurgis-Night,\nThat arbitrarily, here, ourselves we isolate."

