translate english valpurgis_0312:
    voice "voice/valpurgis_0312.ogg"
    c_faust "Wilt thou, to introduce us to the revel,\nAssume the part of wizard or of devil?"

translate english valpurgis_0316:
    voice "voice/valpurgis_0316.ogg"
    c_mephisto "I’m mostly used, ’tis true, to go incognito,\nBut on a gala-day one may his orders show.\nThe Garter does not deck my suit,\nBut honored and at home is here the cloven foot."
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "Perceiv’st thou yonder snail? It cometh, slow and steady;\nSo delicately its feelers pry,\nThat it hath scented me already:\nI cannot here disguise me, if I try."
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "But come! we’ll go from this fire to a newer:\nI am the go-between, and thou the wooer."

