    voice sustain
    c_narrator "To some, who are sitting around dying embers:"

translate english valpurgis_0337:
    voice sustain
    c_mephisto "Old gentlemen, why at the outskirts? Enter!\nI’d praise you if I found you snugly in the centre,\nWith youth and revel round you like a zone:\nYou each, at home, are quite enough alone."

translate english valpurgis_0341:
