translate english valpurgis_0369:
    voice "voice/valpurgis_0369.ogg"
    c_witches "Ye gentlemen, don’t pass me thus!\nLet not the chance neglected be!\nBehold my wares attentively:\nThe stock is rare and various."
    voice sustain
    c_witches "And yet, there’s nothing I’ve collected—\nNo shop, on earth, like this you’ll find!—\nWhich has not, once, sore hurt inflicted\nUpon the world, and on mankind."
    voice sustain
    c_witches "No dagger’s here, that set not blood to flowing;\nNo cup, that hath not once, within a healthy frame\nPoured speedy death, in poison glowing:\nNo gems, that have not brought a maid to shame;"
    voice sustain
    c_witches "No sword, but severed ties for the unwary,\nOr from behind struck down the adversary."

