    pass

translate english carcel_0191:
    voice "voice/carcel_0191.ogg"
    c_faust "Here words and prayers are nothing worth;\nI’ll venture, then, to bear thee forth."

translate english carcel_0192:
    pass

translate english carcel_0194:
    voice "voice/carcel_0194.ogg"
    c_margarita "No—let me go! I’ll suffer no force!\nGrasp me not so murderously!\nI’ve done, else, all things for the love of thee."

translate english carcel_0197:
    voice "voice/carcel_0197.ogg"
    c_faust "The day dawns: Dearest! Dearest!"

translate english carcel_0198:
    pass

translate english carcel_0200:
    voice "voice/carcel_0200.ogg"
    c_margarita "Day? Yes, the day comes,—the last day breaks for me!\nMy wedding-day it was to be!\nTell no one thou has been with Margaret!\nWoe for my garland! The chances"
    voice sustain
    c_margarita "Are over—’tis all in vain!\nWe shall meet once again,\nBut not at the dances!\nThe crowd is thronging, no word is spoken:"
    voice sustain
    c_margarita "The square below\nAnd the streets overflow:\nThe death-bell tolls, the wand is broken.\nI am seized, and bound, and delivered—"
    voice sustain
    c_margarita "Shoved to the block—they give the sign!\nNow over each neck has quivered\nThe blade that is quivering over mine.\nDumb lies the world like the grave!"

